OL,3,AVolunteers searching for Noah Woods, 3,
OL,4,Atold 'remember you are looking for
OL,5,Afrightened child'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are searching for Noah Woods, 3,
OL,8,Fafter he went missing from a playground
OL,9,Fin Suffolk on Tuesday at about 15:00
OL,10,FBST
OL,12,FNoah was with a relative in Brantham
OL,13,Fand is said to have run off down an
OL,14,Falleyway towards a housing estate -
OL,15,Fwhat we know so far
OL,17,FSuffolk Police says Noah, who is
OL,18,Fpartially deaf and non-verbal, will not
OL,19,Frespond to his name being called
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
