OL,3,A'No one should feel afraid to go to
OL,4,Awork': How shoplifting is hitting high
OL,5,Astreets across England
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 500,000 shoplifting offences
OL,8,Fwere recorded by police forces across
OL,9,FEngland last year ` and just over half
OL,10,Fwere closed without an identified
OL,11,Fsuspect
OL,13,FYou can check the shoplifting figures
OL,14,Ffor your local area using our lookup
OL,15,Ftool
OL,17,FRetail analyst Catherine Shuttleworth
OL,18,Fwarns the crime has become "totally
OL,19,Fnormalised", but Policing Minister
OL,20,FSarah Jones thinks progress is being
OL,21,Fmade
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
