OL,3,AAt least 20 killed after war-damaged
OL,4,AGaza building collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 20 people have been killed,
OL,7,Fincluding five children, and dozens are
OL,8,Fmissing after a war-damaged building
OL,9,Fcollapsed in the Gaza Strip, according
OL,10,Fto rescue teams.
OL,12,FVideos showed the search for bodies and
OL,13,Fsurvivors continuing in the rubble of
OL,14,Fthe six-storey building in the Tal
OL,15,Fal-Hawa area of Gaza City.
OL,17,FLocals said some 10 families had been
OL,18,Fliving in the apartments despite
OL,19,Fwarnings that they were unsafe.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
